1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
Meet Video Edit Studio: your own AI video editor, on your Mac.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,950
Claude cuts the retakes, writes the captions and adds motion graphics. You pick the look.

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:17,400
And this is the Studio, where every choice plays on your own video.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:23,380
You need a Mac with Apple Silicon, and the Claude app.

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,160
Open your browser, and go to github.com.

6
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:33,590
Search for video edit studio, and open the repository.

7
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:39,540
Click the green Code button, then Download ZIP.

8
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:44,160
Open the download. It unzips into a folder.

9
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:47,850
Drag the folder onto your Desktop.

10
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:53,080
Using git? Clone it into your Desktop folder instead.

11
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:58,500
Open the Claude app, and go to the Code tab.

12
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:03,060
Choose the folder on your Desktop.

13
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:07,730
Then type: install this, and send it.

14
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:11,900
Claude asks before it runs anything. Click Allow.

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,420
The first install takes ten to twenty minutes. Then Claude checks everything, and starts the Studio.

16
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:24,560
Prefer Terminal? These three commands do the same.

17
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:28,860
Click the link, and your Studio opens in the browser.

18
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:35,230
Click the name at the top to make it your own brand.

19
00:01:35,330 --> 00:01:38,500
Drag your video onto Upload a video.

20
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:44,760
It transcribes it, and removes the retakes, repeats and dead air by itself.

21
00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:50,030
iPhone HDR is turned into natural colour, too.

22
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:57,400
Now tell Claude what you want. Tap where you'll post it, the vibe, the captions and the graphics.

23
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:05,480
Then say it in your own words, like: yellow keywords, big captions at the bottom, fast cuts.

24
00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:10,550
Click Build my look. Every change shows up, with the reason why.

25
00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:19,460
Or learn a style from videos you like. Drag in a creator's video, and the Studio studies its captions, colours and pacing.

26
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:26,830
Mix and match: take each part from the video you like best, then click Make it my style.

27
00:02:26,930 --> 00:02:34,970
Only the style is kept. The video is deleted once it's studied, and none of it goes in your edit.

28
00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:42,490
Have Claude Code? Click Auto-edit, and Claude edits the whole video the way you asked.

29
00:02:42,590 --> 00:02:49,470
Fine-tune anything in the steps: your colours, and your fonts.

30
00:02:49,570 --> 00:02:55,720
In Hook, Hook Lab finds your strongest line. Click Use as cold open.

31
00:02:55,820 --> 00:03:02,390
Pick a caption style. Safe zones shows what TikTok and Reels will cover.

32
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:12,080
Then in Visuals, open 2026 trends: 44 motion graphics, like this new before and after wipe.

33
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:18,830
Tick the ones you like, and Claude places them on the right lines.

34
00:03:18,930 --> 00:03:22,500
Next, Watch. Click Render preview.

35
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:29,280
Run Edit Health. It finds repeated words, dead air and colour problems.

36
00:03:29,380 --> 00:03:33,580
Each item has a fix. One click, and it's done.

37
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:39,460
To change anything, pause there and leave a note, like: cut the dead air.

38
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:45,440
Then click Apply notes with Claude, and Claude fixes them all.

39
00:03:45,540 --> 00:03:49,410
When it looks right, export the final 1080p.

40
00:03:49,510 --> 00:03:57,160
Build the Post Kit: vertical, square and wide videos, captions and a cover, ready to post.

41
00:03:57,260 --> 00:04:02,610
And save your look as a Brand Kit, to use on every video.

42
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:07,522
That's it! Grab it on GitHub, and happy editing.
